  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="64">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 64</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa his rihtæwe lifigende forlæte 7 on oðran wife on unriht gewifige, næbbe he Godes myldse, buton he hit gebete.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone abandons a living legal wife, and wrongly takes to wife another woman, may he not have God's mercy, unless he atones for it.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone deserts his living lawful wife and wrongfully weds another woman, let him not receive God's mercy unless he does penance for it.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
